    `states the right to negotiate the billing method` IS TRUE
    `states the right to a bill and to ask for an itemised bill` IS TRUE
    `states the right to the Board's help in a costs dispute` IS TRUE
    `I took reasonable steps to see the client understood and consented` IS TRUE

