    `the date the bill was given` IS (Date 1 5 2029)
    `the client received an itemised bill after asking under s 187` IS FALSE
    `the date the itemised bill was received` IS (Date 1 5 2029)
    `a costs dispute before the Board is unresolved` IS FALSE
    `a costs assessment is applied for and not complete` IS FALSE
    `disclosure failed and the costs are not yet assessed or determined` IS FALSE

